# ═══ SUBSTRATE STATE (the P1+P4 substrate was ALREADY shipped) ═══
1. cli_prove_claim handler (cli_handlers.rs:8833)
   - production entry point for 5 ClaimKind variants
   - dispatches to touring_offensive::solver::prove_claim

2. ClaimKind enum (touring-offensive/src/solver.rs:626+)
   - Postcondition { predicate: String }
   - LoopInvariant { var, init, body_smtlib }
   - RefactorEquivalence { before, after }
   - TypeSafety { var, sort, lower, upper }
   - MemorySafety { ptr, base, offset_lo, offset_hi }

3. prove_claim function (touring-offensive/src/solver.rs:962)
   - dispatches to Stub|Void by default (P1 stand-down architect contract)
   - dispatches to Z3|Sat|Unsat when #[cfg(feature = "z3")] is enabled

4. Z3 backend (#[cfg(feature="z3")] at solver.rs:1005-1009)
   - Calls z3_backend at solver.rs:1011
   - Returns ProofStatus::{Sat, Unsat, Unknown, Void, Error}

5. EXECUTABLE-CONTRACTS half (separate, also live)
   - touring change-contract (crates/touring-hooks/src/gateway/change_contract.rs)
   - ChangeContract evaluates NoCompositeRegression, NoDimensionRegression, MinComposite
   - Returns ContractVerdict{committed, violations-per-claim}

