# ═══ HONEST RESIDUAL (why 0.85, not 1.0) ═══
the PROOF-ASSISTANT half is closed ONLY for arithmetic claims:
  - LIA, NIA, QF_LIA, SMT-LIB-compatible
the ARBITRARY type-theoretic claims remain a future epic:
  - Lean (4), Coq, dependent-types — these need a TACTIC PROVER, not an SMT solver
  - Z3 is not a type-checker

